    - target: {fileID: 6735154406528815058, guid: edec39da6b5fcc4469939a92f5118ff1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Jonathan finally discards the memory-erasing inator, choosing to stop
        running away from his past.\r\n\r\nHe begins pursuing the hobbies and activities
        he once promised his wife they would experience together. Although she is
        no longer by his side, the memories they shared remain with him, living on
        in his heart.\r\n\r\nHe understands that moving forward doesn't mean forgetting
        the people he has lost, but learning to live with their memories.\r\n\r\nThe
        End...\r\r\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
